@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

actor PSU
entity TPP
entity XS2A
entity SPI
== Submits a bulk of related party verification requests. ==
PSU->TPP: PSU provides creditor information
activate TPP
TPP->XS2A: REST Call Submit Verification of Party\n"/v1/{bulk-party-verification-endpoint}
activate XS2A
note right of XS2A
Resquest validator
- validato path variables
- validate request body
- validate headers
validate bulk-party-verification-endpoint content
end note
XS2A->SPI: Java Call SPISubmitBulkVerificationOfParty(PartyVerificationRequestList )
activate SPI
|||
SPI-->XS2A: (http codes: 200)SpiBulkVerificationOfPartyResponse(complete, MTCH)
deactivate SPI
XS2A-->TPP: Verification of Party Response
deactivate XS2A
|||
TPP-->PSU: Response to PSU
|||
PSU->TPP: initiate bulkPayment
@enduml
